{"articleNo":"70346","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=70346&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"“2012 청년 등 사회적기업가 페스티벌”","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.11.22","hit":"13019","attachments":[{"name":"포스터.JPG","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=70346&attachNo=22795"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">한국사회적기업진흥원에서는 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">창의적이고 혁신적인 사회적기업가를 육성하기 위하여</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">「청년 등 사회적기업가 육성사업」을 시행하고 있습니다.</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">「청년 등 사회적기업가 육성사업」을 통해 육성된 창업팀의 사업성과 및 활동을 적극 홍보하고</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">사업참여자간 유대강화를 위한</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">“2012 </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">청년 등 사회적기업가 페스티벌</u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">”</span></u></span></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">을 개최하니 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 행&nbsp; 사&nbsp; &nbsp;명 : 2012 청년 등 사회적기업가 페스티벌</span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 일&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 시 : 2012.11.27.(화) 10:00~17:00</span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 소 : 서울시 서초구 양재동 aT센터 제2전시장</span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 주 요&nbsp;내 용 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">우수참여자 포상, 창업토크콘서트, 창업팀 쇼케이스 및 </span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">공연, 박람회, 사업설명회</span></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; (사회적기업 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">인증 및 판로개척, 청년 등 사회적기업가 육성사업, 협동조합)</span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(자세한 사항은 한국사회적기업진흥원 홈페이지(</span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">http://www.socialenterprise.or.kr)</u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">를</u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 참조하시기 바랍니다.)</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span></span></span><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/858d3bfb-c639-464a-ab2b-c0d9c5201de6.JPG\"> \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
